{
  "name": "01 \u00b7 Email Triage (LLM)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 \u00b7 Email Triage\n\n**Demo (<10 min)**\n1. Import this file in n8n\n2. Attach **OpenAI** credential on *Classify Priority & Intent*\n3. Activate or click **Test workflow**\n4. POST sample JSON to the webhook URL\n\n**Inbound stub:** Webhook stands in for IMAP/Email Trigger. Swap for `Email Trigger (IMAP)` when ready.\n\n**Sample body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"from\": \"alex@example.com\",\n  \"subject\": \"Urgent: invoice overdue\",\n  \"body\": \"Please escalate \u2014 payment failed.\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "be52f43c-8de0-480c-8e40-f69fde3190b8",
      "name": "Note \u2014 Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "email-triage",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2b06ca8c-00a2-45c7-b7f5-d14f23176e9e",
      "name": "Inbound Email Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "fc64b2c7-d2a3-4502-884a-b54cfb4987d9",
      "notes": "Stub for IMAP/Email Trigger. Expects JSON: from, subject, body.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "8397f1d2-1ee0-4107-af7e-9cb3224464dc",
              "name": "from",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.from || $json.from || 'unknown@example.com' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1d9840e-c9ae-40d6-ba0c-3f6b9ad69bb0",
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.subject || $json.subject || '(no subject)' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e0a458e2-2628-4eb3-a404-685c6c2e3780",
              "name": "body",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.body || $json.body.text || $json.body || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f23e6612-6e29-4825-95bb-5e19407e6542",
      "name": "Normalize Email Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "text",
        "operation": "message",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You triage inbound email for an ops team. Return ONLY JSON with keys: priority (critical|high|normal|low), intent (billing|support|sales|spam|other), label (short slug), summary (1 sentence), route (escalate|support_queue|sales_queue|archive)."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=From: {{ $json.from }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\n\n{{ $json.body }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": true,
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1,
          "maxTokens": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "bb1c3c59-f93a-442e-bb42-689aad78d925",
      "name": "Classify Priority & Intent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Map this to your OpenAI (or OpenAI-compatible) credential after import.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c0235a4b-4e28-403a-85a4-5e1a9d2a47de",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route || $json.message?.content?.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "escalate",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "escalate"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "949ecda4-7330-44c1-80c6-511fed6abbdd",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route || $json.message?.content?.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "sales_queue",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "sales"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "id": "d666be18-3410-4cb5-93a7-97bd637dbcf0",
      "name": "Route by Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        820,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Routes on LLM `route` field. Fallback = support/archive path.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b7494c7a-795c-4c08-a8b3-62793c77ae5f",
              "name": "action",
              "value": "escalated",
              "type": "string"
            },
